WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.966 --> 00:00:05.666
We've seen battle after ferocious battle at the Kalos League,

2
00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:08.066
and now it's time for our final match!

3
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.766
So, let's welcome the two trainers

4
00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:13.433
who have battled their way here with honor.

5
00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:15.700
Ash!

6
00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:19.633
And Alain!

7
00:00:23.566 --> 00:00:25.233
You can do it, Alain.

8
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.900
It's finally time.

9
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.566
Man, Alain's strong. We'll have to give it all we've got.

10
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.433
I've really been looking forward to this battle with Ash.

11
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.400
But I won't let him win it, no matter what.

12
00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:47.433
And here's our first battlefield for the finals.

13
00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:51.733
It's water and rock.

14
00:00:58.866 --> 00:01:02.700
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

15
00:01:02.766 --> 00:01:06.733
♪ Knock me down, I'll just get up again ♪

16
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.933
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

17
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.833
♪ Pokémon ♪

18
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:14.300
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

19
00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:17.566
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

20
00:01:17.633 --> 00:01:19.566
♪ Pokémon ♪

21
00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:22.433
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

22
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.100
It's the final round.

23
00:01:35.166 --> 00:01:36.966
Who will emerge victorious?

24
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.700
Will it be Ash, or Alain?

25
00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:41.433
We'll find out soon.

26
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.866
The Kalos League battle between Ash and Alain is about to get underway.

27
00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:50.333
When all six of either trainer's Pokémon are unable to continue,

28
00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.033
the battle will be over.

29
00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:57.366
In addition, when three of the Pokémon on one side are unable to continue,

30
00:01:57.433 --> 00:01:59.766
the battlefield will change.

31
00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.666
Bring out your Pokémon!

32
00:02:02.733 --> 00:02:04.600
Pikachu, I choose you!

33
00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:05.866
Pika!

34
00:02:06.233 --> 00:02:08.166
Pikachu!

35
00:02:08.233 --> 00:02:09.800
Tyranitar, go!

36
00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:18.633
Pika...

37
00:02:19.566 --> 00:02:22.100
- This could be trouble.
- What do you know?

38
00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:24.266
Alain's battling with a Tyranitar.

39
00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:27.033
And since Tyranitar's ability is sand stream,

40
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:30.300
that will make it hard for Pikachu to see and move around.

41
00:02:30.366 --> 00:02:32.566
Don't worry. Ash can handle it.

42
00:02:32.866 --> 00:02:34.100
Go get 'em, Ash!

43
00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:36.766
Go get 'em, Pikachu.

44
00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:39.033
All right, battle begin!

45
00:02:39.766 --> 00:02:41.066
Get ready, Alain.

46
00:02:41.433 --> 00:02:42.700
Bring it on, Ash.

47
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:47.933
Tyranitar, dark pulse!

48
00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:52.100
- Dodge it, Pikachu!
- Pika!

49
00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:58.733
That's it! Pikachu, get to the water and use iron tail.

50
00:03:05.133 --> 00:03:06.700
Thunderbolt, quick!

51
00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.200
Not bad.

52
00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:18.166
- All right!
- They cleared the sandstorm with water.

53
00:03:18.233 --> 00:03:20.100
And water conducts electricity.

54
00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:23.166
Using thunderbolt was a great strategy. Ash is doing great.

55
00:03:23.866 --> 00:03:26.766
- Hmph.
- And we're just getting warmed up.

56
00:03:26.833 --> 00:03:29.133
Electro ball.

57
00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.733
Stone edge, go!

58
00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.300
Hit it with your tail.

59
00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.566
Hit them back with iron tail.

60
00:03:48.533 --> 00:03:50.600
Wait for it to land, then use crunch.

61
00:03:51.566 --> 00:03:52.866
Pika, Pi!

62
00:03:52.933 --> 00:03:54.433
Quick, iron tail.

63
00:04:00.066 --> 00:04:01.933
Now electro ball.

64
00:04:09.966 --> 00:04:12.033
Tyranitar's unable to battle.

65
00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.766
Pikachu's the winner.

66
00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.366
An impressive win, no doubt.

67
00:04:16.433 --> 00:04:19.100
And Ash is off to an early lead.

68
00:04:19.666 --> 00:04:22.133
We've got one win right out of the box.

69
00:04:23.666 --> 00:04:25.000
All right!

70
00:04:25.466 --> 00:04:27.300
Wow, that was a quick victory.

71
00:04:27.366 --> 00:04:30.433
Having the first win totally puts Ash in the driver's seat.

72
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.166
If he gets five more wins, he's the champion.

73
00:04:33.233 --> 00:04:36.433
Ash has really been on fire since the semifinals.

74
00:04:36.733 --> 00:04:37.566
Yeah.

75
00:04:42.166 --> 00:04:43.666
And I can't return.

76
00:04:44.733 --> 00:04:48.233
I lost far too many things after I left for my journey.

77
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.900
Until I can get them back...

78
00:04:52.233 --> 00:04:54.833
I have to become much, much stronger.

79
00:05:01.566 --> 00:05:04.600
Alain. What feelings are you holding inside?

80
00:05:05.166 --> 00:05:09.100
It's the Kalos League finals, and the fans are beside themselves.

81
00:05:09.566 --> 00:05:12.133
However, the battle is only just beginning.

82
00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.233
Okay, and cut.

83
00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.733
All right, next shot.

84
00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:16.833
Right.

85
00:05:17.266 --> 00:05:19.966
This battle won't be a walk in the park, you know.

86
00:05:20.033 --> 00:05:22.700
This kind of battling would wear out any Pokémon.

87
00:05:22.766 --> 00:05:25.866
But once they're on empty, that's when we swoop in.

88
00:05:25.933 --> 00:05:27.400
Team Rocket for the win.

89
00:05:27.466 --> 00:05:30.600
First we'll grab the winner's and the runner-up's Pokémon,

90
00:05:30.666 --> 00:05:31.900
including Pikachu.

91
00:05:31.966 --> 00:05:34.833
Those dumb twerpy dimwits won't know what to do.

92
00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.600
We've got work to do.

93
00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.700
A-working we will go.

94
00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.366
Pika, Pi!

95
00:05:41.433 --> 00:05:44.233
Awesome. Pikachu, why don't you rest up for now?

96
00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:45.633
Pikachu.

97
00:05:45.966 --> 00:05:47.500
Noivern, I choose you.

98
00:05:50.966 --> 00:05:53.833
This feeling. I've been waiting for it.

99
00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:55.766
Let's go, Weavile!

100
00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:59.333
Weavile!

101
00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.533
Our next battle is between Noivern and Weavile.

102
00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.633
Okay, Noivern, supersonic.

103
00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.900
-Weavile, protect.

104
00:06:10.233 --> 00:06:11.100
Weavile!

105
00:06:13.066 --> 00:06:14.300
Night slash.

106
00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:20.700
Supersonic!

107
00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.900
Now ice beam.

108
00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:29.366
Use boomburst.

109
00:06:34.033 --> 00:06:35.100
Now dragon claw!

110
00:06:41.566 --> 00:06:43.100
Double team, go!

111
00:06:45.266 --> 00:06:47.533
Use supersonic and find the real one.

112
00:06:51.966 --> 00:06:52.900
There it is.

113
00:06:53.633 --> 00:06:54.800
Huh? Dodge!

114
00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.400
Use ice beam!

115
00:07:00.366 --> 00:07:01.433
Dodge it, quick!

116
00:07:06.866 --> 00:07:07.866
Ah!

117
00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:11.000
Night slash!

118
00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.333
- Noivern is unable to battle.

119
00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.466
- Weavile's the winner.
- Weavile comes out on top

120
00:07:28.533 --> 00:07:31.533
- by aiming an ice beam at Noivern's wings.
- Noivern.

121
00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:32.900
Pika, Pika!

122
00:07:33.833 --> 00:07:35.366
Noivern, are you okay?

123
00:07:44.866 --> 00:07:46.766
Noivern, take a good rest.

124
00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:51.033
- Okay. It's all yours.
- Lucha!

125
00:07:51.466 --> 00:07:52.600
Haw.

126
00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:56.500
- Noivern...
- Now both sides are all evened up.

127
00:07:56.733 --> 00:07:57.633
It's okay.

128
00:07:58.033 --> 00:07:59.933
Hawlucha will get Weavile back.

129
00:08:00.066 --> 00:08:01.966
Hawlucha, let's go!

130
00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:06.600
Hmph.

131
00:08:06.666 --> 00:08:08.666
Hawlucha, use karate chop.

132
00:08:09.933 --> 00:08:10.833
Dodge it!

133
00:08:14.433 --> 00:08:16.833
And Hawlucha launches a fierce attack.

134
00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:18.700
Weavile can barely dodge it.

135
00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:23.033
Fighting-type moves are effective against Weavile.

136
00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:26.233
- That was a good call.
- But that's only if they make contact.

137
00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:28.866
Weavile's totally aware of what's going on.

138
00:08:31.433 --> 00:08:33.900
Now direct ice beam at Hawlucha's feet.

139
00:08:40.633 --> 00:08:41.933
An ice field, huh?

140
00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.766
Ice beam, let's go.

141
00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.933
Stay where you are.

142
00:08:55.733 --> 00:08:56.933
Whoa.

143
00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.600
Now use night slash.

144
00:08:59.466 --> 00:09:00.766
Not yet!

145
00:09:08.633 --> 00:09:09.733
Oh, wow.

146
00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:12.300
It's using the ice to reduce any damage.

147
00:09:12.366 --> 00:09:14.366
We'll try this again. Night slash!

148
00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.133
Hang in there.

149
00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.100
And it's a ferocious attack from Weavile. Is that it for Hawlucha?

150
00:09:29.266 --> 00:09:30.566
No, it's standing.

151
00:09:30.633 --> 00:09:32.566
Hawlucha is still standing.

152
00:09:35.733 --> 00:09:39.666
Hawlucha takes an opponent's attacks and just keeps on getting stronger.

153
00:09:40.233 --> 00:09:41.366
Look out, Alain.

154
00:09:42.966 --> 00:09:44.100
As you wish.

155
00:09:44.333 --> 00:09:45.366
Night slash!

156
00:09:46.566 --> 00:09:48.433
All right, Hawlucha, go!

157
00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.300
Now. Flying press!

158
00:10:09.066 --> 00:10:12.366
Weavile's unable to battle. So, Hawlucha's the winner.

159
00:10:12.433 --> 00:10:13.866
All right!

160
00:10:13.933 --> 00:10:15.233
Pika, Pika!

161
00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.700
Hawlucha pulls off a turnaround victory

162
00:10:17.766 --> 00:10:19.533
with a sharp aerial attack.

163
00:10:20.133 --> 00:10:21.466
Hawlucha was great.

164
00:10:21.533 --> 00:10:24.633
Ash really used Hawlucha's fighting style to the max.

165
00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:28.400
Yeah. Hawlucha believes in Ash and Ash believes in Hawlucha.

166
00:10:28.466 --> 00:10:29.666
That's for sure.

167
00:10:29.733 --> 00:10:32.033
Trust is what Ash is all about.

168
00:10:33.233 --> 00:10:35.100
Ash has some fine Pokémon.

169
00:10:35.533 --> 00:10:37.600
Alain, you can do it.

170
00:10:38.033 --> 00:10:39.633
Bisharp. Let's go!

171
00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:44.200
Bisharp!

172
00:10:44.266 --> 00:10:47.600
And Alain's third Pokémon will be Bisharp!

173
00:10:47.666 --> 00:10:49.900
Be sure to stay focused, Hawlucha.

174
00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.300
Thunder wave!

175
00:10:56.966 --> 00:11:00.500
- Uh-oh. Hawlucha, no!
- That was Bisharp's thunder wave.

176
00:11:00.566 --> 00:11:03.066
After that last battle, Hawlucha's in a jam.

177
00:11:03.133 --> 00:11:05.466
- Stand up, Hawlucha.
- Pikachu!

178
00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:09.266
Use guillotine.

179
00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:10.800
X-scissor!

180
00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.100
Now high jump kick!

181
00:11:25.066 --> 00:11:26.166
Dodge it!

182
00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.433
-Guillotine, go!

183
00:11:43.266 --> 00:11:45.266
Hawlucha is unable to battle.

184
00:11:45.333 --> 00:11:46.966
Bisharp's the winner.

185
00:11:47.033 --> 00:11:51.033
And there you have it. That was the powerful move, guillotine.

186
00:11:51.466 --> 00:11:53.433
I thought Ash had the advantage.

187
00:11:53.666 --> 00:11:55.166
He was up with two wins.

188
00:11:55.233 --> 00:11:56.933
But Alain evened the score.

189
00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.100
That guy's tough.

190
00:11:59.433 --> 00:12:01.633
Awesome, Hawlucha. You were great.

191
00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.033
Now take a good rest.

192
00:12:04.733 --> 00:12:07.433
Battling against Ash is a lot of fun.

193
00:12:07.966 --> 00:12:11.233
I don't remember the last time I've had so much fun.

194
00:12:11.733 --> 00:12:14.600
It allows me to forget about time completely.

195
00:12:14.666 --> 00:12:16.966
Unfezant, let's go!

196
00:12:19.666 --> 00:12:21.233
Talonflame, you're up.

197
00:12:35.933 --> 00:12:37.733
Steel wing, let's go!

198
00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:48.500
Tremendous impact!

199
00:12:49.766 --> 00:12:51.466
Talonflame, flame charge.

200
00:12:56.866 --> 00:12:58.266
Use sky attack!

201
00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.166
Air slash!

202
00:13:15.533 --> 00:13:17.000
Dodge it, Talonflame!

203
00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.866
Ramp up your speed. With a flame charge.

204
00:13:29.133 --> 00:13:30.433
Talon!

205
00:13:30.866 --> 00:13:31.966
Dodge it!

206
00:13:36.166 --> 00:13:37.333
Use sky attack.

207
00:13:41.033 --> 00:13:43.233
All right, Talonflame, brave bird.

208
00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.033
And brave bird and sky attack collide head-on.

209
00:13:57.033 --> 00:13:59.400
- What just happened?
- Huh?

210
00:14:00.466 --> 00:14:01.900
- Talonflame!
- Pika!

211
00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:05.900
Talonflame and Unfezant are both unable to battle.

212
00:14:06.166 --> 00:14:11.000
That huge aerial collision has resulted in a double knockout!

213
00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.066
Who's that Pokémon?

214
00:14:21.266 --> 00:14:23.066
It's Metagross.

215
00:14:23.133 --> 00:14:24.400
Meta!

216
00:14:28.666 --> 00:14:31.366
Just three Pokémon remaining per side,

217
00:14:31.433 --> 00:14:33.633
so, it's time for a new battlefield.

218
00:14:34.033 --> 00:14:37.533
Three against three. Means the final match is all tied up,

219
00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.833
which can be tricky.

220
00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:43.366
One mistake can turn everything around. That's the kind of battle this is.

221
00:14:43.433 --> 00:14:45.766
Yeah. I'm nervous, and I'm in the audience.

222
00:14:45.833 --> 00:14:49.766
I'm not sure if you know this, but Ash has never beaten Alain before.

223
00:14:49.833 --> 00:14:50.666
Huh?

224
00:14:50.733 --> 00:14:54.666
- Alain's really that strong?
- But that was the Ash from the past.

225
00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.666
Ash is a lot stronger now than he was back then.

226
00:14:59.166 --> 00:15:00.733
Three Pokémon left.

227
00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.466
- Pika, Pi.
- Huh?

228
00:15:03.133 --> 00:15:04.366
Pika, Pika!

229
00:15:04.733 --> 00:15:07.000
Yeah! I've got my whole team.

230
00:15:07.066 --> 00:15:09.166
And all of you know you've got me.

231
00:15:09.766 --> 00:15:11.133
Pikachu!

232
00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.100
Hey, Alain!

233
00:15:12.533 --> 00:15:14.266
Let's have fun to the end.

234
00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:18.633
What a competitor.

235
00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:22.866
Seeing his expression makes me wanna battle with everything I've got.

236
00:15:22.933 --> 00:15:25.866
This is why I was so focused on battling him.

237
00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:28.066
Look at that. He's smiling.

238
00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:30.166
I've never seen that before.

239
00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:33.100
Really? Well, here we go.

240
00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.633
The finals' climax will soon be upon us.

241
00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.900
Every eye, and I mean every eye, all over the world,

242
00:15:39.966 --> 00:15:41.933
will be focused on Lumiose City.

243
00:15:43.466 --> 00:15:46.433
The exciting Kalos League finals continue.

244
00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.100
Our second-half battlefield is grass.

245
00:15:49.566 --> 00:15:53.100
What kind of effect will this change have on our battlers' strategies?

246
00:15:53.166 --> 00:15:55.100
Bring out your Pokémon.

247
00:15:55.166 --> 00:15:57.133
Pikachu, I choose you!

248
00:16:00.966 --> 00:16:02.600
Metagross, let's go!

249
00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.266
Once again, Ash chooses Pikachu,

250
00:16:09.333 --> 00:16:12.600
who will now face off against Alain's Metagross.

251
00:16:13.233 --> 00:16:15.166
Battle... begin!

252
00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:18.000
All right, Pikachu, use thunderbolt!

253
00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.333
Use agility.

254
00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:27.733
Move. Quick!

255
00:16:28.033 --> 00:16:29.400
Pika! Pi.

256
00:16:29.466 --> 00:16:30.700
Get closer.

257
00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:34.700
Metal claw.

258
00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.100
Rock slide!

259
00:16:43.466 --> 00:16:45.733
- Pika!
- Pikachu!

260
00:16:55.666 --> 00:16:58.233
- Way to go, Pikachu!
- Pika?

261
00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.500
Meteor mash, go!

262
00:17:00.933 --> 00:17:02.566
- Meta!
- Pika?

263
00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.266
Pikachu!

264
00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:18.666
It wouldn't be too shabby if we got that mighty Metagross on our team.

265
00:17:18.733 --> 00:17:21.733
I always have mixed emotions observing the Pikachu

266
00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:24.166
who's given us trouble all of this time.

267
00:17:24.233 --> 00:17:26.166
A crisis of twerpish proportions.

268
00:17:26.233 --> 00:17:28.266
It doesn't matter who wins.

269
00:17:28.333 --> 00:17:30.300
We'll simply grab both of them.

270
00:17:30.533 --> 00:17:32.733
Right. Simplicity's best.

271
00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.733
Wrap this up. Use meteor mash!

272
00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.466
Meta!

273
00:17:39.533 --> 00:17:41.966
Come on, Pikachu. Electro ball.

274
00:17:49.066 --> 00:17:52.200
- Oh, no.
- And Pikachu hangs in there with gusto.

275
00:17:52.266 --> 00:17:53.400
Jump on Metagross.

276
00:17:57.133 --> 00:17:59.133
Shake it off!

277
00:18:01.866 --> 00:18:04.066
Pikachu, use thunderbolt. Let's go!

278
00:18:07.866 --> 00:18:10.433
It's a surprise thunderbolt from Pikachu.

279
00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.266
Can Metagross withstand it?

280
00:18:12.866 --> 00:18:16.000
As long as Pikachu's on top, Metagross can't attack.

281
00:18:16.066 --> 00:18:20.033
But will Metagross go down first, or will Pikachu get shaken off first?

282
00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:21.766
Good luck, Pikachu.

283
00:18:24.866 --> 00:18:26.700
Metagross is struggling.

284
00:18:26.766 --> 00:18:29.033
That thunderbolt is powerful!

285
00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:30.533
Come on, Metagross!

286
00:18:35.366 --> 00:18:36.533
Pika!

287
00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:41.000
Pikachu, use iron tail.

288
00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.133
Pika!

289
00:18:49.033 --> 00:18:50.866
Metagross is unable to battle.

290
00:18:50.933 --> 00:18:52.533
- Pikachu wins.
- Way to go!

291
00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.333
Pika!

292
00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.800
What a comeback by Pikachu!

293
00:18:56.866 --> 00:18:59.000
An amazing turnaround.

294
00:19:01.533 --> 00:19:03.633
- All right!
- Now it's three against two.

295
00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:06.900
- Ash is back in the lead.
- But he's up against Alain.

296
00:19:06.966 --> 00:19:10.533
- He can't lose focus.
- And Pikachu's taken a lot of damage.

297
00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:12.033
Talk about a surprise.

298
00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:16.266
It's not over until it's over. I think Ash can still pull this battle off.

299
00:19:16.333 --> 00:19:17.166
Yes!

300
00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.766
Huh?

301
00:19:18.833 --> 00:19:21.900
Hey, time-out. If it doesn't matter who wins this,

302
00:19:21.966 --> 00:19:24.100
then I'm simply cheering for the twerp.

303
00:19:24.166 --> 00:19:26.266
- Mmm.

304
00:19:30.166 --> 00:19:31.733
Charizard, let's go!

305
00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.400
- Charizard's up next.
- Mmm!

306
00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:46.900
Pika, Pika!

307
00:19:48.966 --> 00:19:51.900
Okay. Now you've really gotta bring it.

308
00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.666
- Pika!
- Use quick attack.

309
00:20:00.566 --> 00:20:02.100
Now thunderbolt!

310
00:20:05.366 --> 00:20:07.433
From quick attack to thunderbolt,

311
00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.733
Pikachu's really ramping it up.

312
00:20:10.166 --> 00:20:12.633
Wow, it's working.

313
00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.733
The thunderbolt is effective against Charizard. Good idea.

314
00:20:26.533 --> 00:20:29.233
Oh, Ash, Pikachu, good luck.

315
00:20:30.566 --> 00:20:32.566
Will Pikachu emerge victorious?

316
00:20:32.633 --> 00:20:34.733
- Or will it be Charizard?
- Pika...

317
00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:38.833
And who will earn the prestigious title of Kalos League Champion?

318
00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.466
The white-hot battle between Ash and Alain is nearing its conclusion,

319
00:20:42.533 --> 00:20:45.800
so stay tuned, as the journey continues.
